    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">**About This Work**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a short visual novel with a runtime of only about ten minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story takes place in a future world set in a parallel universe. After a series of global pandemics and nuclear wars, the Earth's population has drastically declined. The surviving humans have spontaneously formed communities and live in a manner similar to primitive societies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a certain morning after a snowstorm, Kalinda wakes up from her sleep and opens her eyes to find her partner smiling at her\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cGood morning.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">**Controls**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- **Right Mouse Button** \u2014 Return</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- **Left Mouse Button / Enter Key** \u2014 Advance to the next line</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- **Ctrl Key** \u2014 Fast Forward</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">**About the Author**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Author's Bilibili ID: \u7075\u865a\u4e4b\u5e7d</p>",
